(1. Phase 1 goals) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
T*
(================) Tj
T*
(  ? Create a reproducible PostgreSQL schema via Supabase migrations.) Tj
T*
(  ? Enforce multi-tenant isolation with business_id and RLS.) Tj
T*
(  ? Provide secure customer RPCs without customer Auth accounts.) Tj
T*
(  ? Enforce queue entry state transitions in the database.) Tj
T*
(  ? Generate accurate TypeScript types from the live schema.) Tj
T*
(  ? Add typed Supabase clients \(browser, server, admin\).) Tj
T*
