(  ? Adds updated_at triggers and integrity triggers \(queue/service same business;) Tj
T*
(    entry/queue same business\).) Tj
T*
(  ? Adds handle_new_user trigger \(auth.users -> profiles\).) Tj
T*
(  ? Adds handle_new_business trigger \(creator becomes business_owner\).) Tj
T*
(Design note: queue_entries.business_id is denormalized for efficient RLS without recursive) Tj
T*
/F2 11 Tf
(joins.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
T*
(  3.2 20260906180100_rls_policies.sql) Tj
T*
(  -----------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F2 11 Tf
(Implements tenant isolation and access control.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
T*
(  ? Defines SECURITY DEFINER helpers: is_business_member\(business_id\),) Tj
T*
(    is_business_owner\(business_id\).) Tj
T*
(  ? Enables and forces RLS on every application table.) Tj
T*
(  ? profiles: users can select/update only their own row.) Tj
T*
(  ? businesses: members can read; authenticated can insert; owners can update/delete.) Tj
T*
(  ? business_members: peers can read; owners manage memberships.) Tj
T*
(  ? services / queues: members read; owners write.) Tj
T*
(  ? queue_entries: members may SELECT only; no direct INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE for anon or) Tj
T*
(    authenticated.) Tj
T*
(  ? Column grants hide access_token_hash from authenticated/anon clients.) Tj
T*
(  3.3 20260906180200_rpc_functions.sql) Tj
T*
(  ------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F2 11 Tf
(Creates secure RPC foundations for customers and staff.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
T*
(  ? join_queue\(queue_id, customer_name, customer_phone?\) ? validates open queue, locks queue) Tj
T*
(    row, increments current_number safely, stores SHA-256 token hash only, returns public_id) Tj
T*
(    + raw token + queue_number + status.) Tj
T*
(  ? get_ticket\(public_id, access_token\) ? verifies token hash; returns status, people_ahead,) Tj
T*
(    estimated_wait_minutes \(people_ahead x average_service_minutes\), service/business/queue) Tj
T*
(    names. Never returns token hash.) Tj
T*
(  ? cancel_ticket\(public_id, access_token\) ? waiting -> skipped only.) Tj
T*
(  ? transition_entry\(entry_id, new_status\) ? authenticated members only; enforces state) Tj
T*
(    machine.) Tj
T*
/F2 11 Tf
(Allowed transitions:) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
T*
(    waiting  -> called | skipped) Tj
T*
(    called   -> serving | skipped | no_show) Tj
T*
(    serving  -> completed | no_show) Tj
T*
(    terminal -> completed | skipped | no_show) Tj
T*
(  3.4 20260906180300_harden_function_grants.sql) Tj
T*
(  ---------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Tightens EXECUTE privileges because Supabase may broadly grant execute on public functions.) Tj
T*
(  ? Revokes transition_entry and membership helpers from anon.) Tj
T*
(  ? Keeps join_queue / get_ticket / cancel_ticket available to anon + authenticated.) Tj
T*
(  ? Keeps internal hash/token helpers non-executable by clients.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
