(  ? Customers have no auth.users accounts.) Tj
T*
(  ? Customer access is token-based \(raw token once; hash stored\).) Tj
T*
(  ? Business A cannot read Business B data \(membership + business_id RLS\).) Tj
T*
(  ? Staff cannot directly mutate queue_entries; must use transition_entry.) Tj
T*
(  ? SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY must never be exposed to the browser.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
